{"schema":"contra-studio/contradb-interpretation","version":1,"sourceSnapshotId":"contradb:265:dac05eb81b8c4184","snapshot":{"schema":"contra-studio/contradb-snapshot","version":1,"sourceUrl":"https://contradb.com/dances/265","retrievedAt":"2026-10-20T06:21:11.518Z","html":"<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Trip to Kentucky (original)</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/55\">Jerome Grisanti</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: improper </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">long lines forward</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>4</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons roll away neighbors with a half sashay (roll left to right)</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons allemande left 1½</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 dance-show-long-figure\">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>16</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners balance &amp; swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">right left through (with courtesy turn)</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles chain (to neighbor)</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle right 4 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">neighbors swing ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>I rather like Chet Gray&#39;s variation, which replaces the B2 neighbor <u>swing</u> with a 2-hand turn counter clockwise.</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"},"interpretation":{"notesReview":"retain-table-optional-alternative","rows":{"contradb:265:row:0":{"linesRollaway":{"phase":"return","direction":"left-to-right"}},"contradb:265:row:3":{"balanceBeats":4},"contradb:265:row:4":{"rightLeftThrough":{"hand":"right","courtesyReceiver":"partner","courtesyLeader":"lark","crossingRelation":"neighbor"}},"contradb:265:row:5":{"chainReceiver":"neighbor"}}}}
